hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1956","[AI-translation] ´Muhammad (bin Sireen) kehtay hain ke` logon ne fakhr kiya ya zikr kiya ke jannat mein mard zyada hun ge ya aurtein zyada hun gi Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kiya Abul Qasim sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nahi farmaya ke albatta pehla giroh jo jannat mein jaye ga wo chaudhween raat ke chaand ki tarah ho ga aur jo giroh us ke baad jaye ga wo aasmaan ke baray chamakdaar taare (sitaray) ki tarah ho ga un mein se har mard ke liye do biwiyan hun gi jin ki pindlion ka gooda gosht ke pare nazar aaye ga aur jannat mein koi ghair shaadi shuda na ho ga "
"1957","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sab se pehle jo giroh jannat mein jaye ga wo chaudhween raat ke chaand ki tarah ho ga phir jo giroh un ke baad jaye ga wo sab se zyada chamaktay hue taare (sitaray) ki tarah ho ga aur phir un ke baad kai darjay hun ge aur jinti na peshaab karein ge na pakhana na thookein ge na naak sinkein ge un ki kanghiaan sonay ki hun gi aur paseena se mushk ki boo aaye gi un ki angeethiyon mein ood sulgay ga aur un ki biwiyan bari bari aankhon wali hoorein hun gi aur un ki aadatein aik shakhs ki aadaton ke muwafiq hun gi (yani sab ke akhlaaq yaksaan hun ge) apne baap Adam alaihissalam ki qad o qaamat yani saath haath ka qad ho ga bin Abu Shaiba ne kaha ke un ka akhlaaq aik jaisa ho ga aur Abu Kuraib ne kaha ke un ki paidaayish aik tarah ki ho gi aur bin Abu Shaiba ne kaha ke wo apne walid (Adam alaihissalam) ki soorat par hun ge "
"1958","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Adam alaihissalam ko apni soorat par banaya aur un ka qad saath haath ka tha jab un ko bana chuka to farmaya ke jao aur giroh ki shakal mein baithay hue farishton ko salam karo aur suno ke wo tujhe kiya jawab detay hain kyunke tera aur teri aulad ka yehi salam ho ga Adam alaihissalam gaye aur kaha ke salam alaikum farishton ne jawab mein kaha ke salam alaik wa rehmatullah Allah yani wa rehmatullah Allah barha diya sau jo koi behisht mein jaye ga wo Adam alaihissalam ki soorat par ho ga yani saath haath ka lamba Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Adam alaihissalam saath haath ke thay phir un ke baad logon ke qad ab tak ghattay gaye "
"1959","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein kuch log aisay jayein ge ke un ke dil parindon ke dilon jaisay hun ge (yani narmi ke lihaaz se ya Allah par bharosa karnay ke aitbaar se) "
"1960","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal jinti logon se farmaye ga ke Ae jannatiyo ! pas wo kahein ge ke Ae Rab ! ham khidmat mein haazir hain aur sab bhalayi tere haathon mein hai Allah Taala farmaye ga ke kiya tum raazi hue wo kahein ge ke ham kaisay raazi na hun ge hamein to ne wo diya ke itna apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko nahi diya Allah Taala farmaye ga ke kiya mein tumhein us se bhi koi umda cheez dun wo arz karein ge ke Ae Rab ! us se umda kaun si cheez hai Allah Taala farmaye ga ke mein ne tum par apni razamandi utaar di aur ab mein us ke baad kabhi tum par ghussa na hun ga "
"1961","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak jannat ke log upar ki manzil walon ko aisay dekhein ge jaisay sitaray ko dekhtay hain jo chamakta hua ho aur door aasmaan ke kinaaray par mashriq mein ya Maghrib mein ho ye us wajah se hai ke un mein darjon ka farq ho ga logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye darjay to paighambaron ke hun ge aur kisi ko nahi milein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kyun nahi qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai un darjon mein wo log hun ge jo Allah par iman laaye aur unhon ne paighambaron ko sacha jana (yani paighambaron ka darja us se kahein zyada ho ga) "
"1962","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein janay walay khayein peyein ge lekin na thookein ge na naak saaf karein ge aur na peshaab ki haajat ho gi lekin un ka khana kastoori ki mushk jaisa aik dakaar ho ga (bas dakaar aur paseena se khana tehleel ho jaye ga) unhein tasbeeh o tahmeed (yani SubhanAllah Allah aur Alhamdulillah kehna) ka aisay hi ilhaam ho ga jaisay saans ka ilhaam hota hai "
"1963","[AI-translation] ´Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) maula Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas khara tha ke Yahudi aalimon mein se aik aalim aaya aur bola ke salam alaikum ya Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! mein ne us ko aisay zor se aik dhakka diya ke wo girtay girtay bacha wo bola ke to mujhe dhakka kyun deta hai mein ne kaha ke to (Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka naam leta hai aur) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kyun nahi kehta wo bola ke ham un ko us naam se pukaartay hain jo un ke ghar walon ne rakha hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mera naam jo ghar walon ne rakha hai wo Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hai Yahudi ne kaha ke mein tumharay paas kuch poochnay ko aaya hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke bhala mein agar tujhe kuch batlaun to tujhe faida ho ga us ne kaha ke mein apne donon kaanon se sunon ga Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us chhari se jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haath mubarak mein thi zameen par lakeer kheenchi (jaisay koi sochtay waqt karta hai) aur farmaya ke pooch Yahudi ne kaha ke jis din ye zameen aasmaan badal kar doosray zameen o aasmaan hun ge log us waqt kahan hun ge Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke log us waqt andheray mein pul siraat ke paas kharay hun ge us ne poocha ke phir sab se pehle kaun log us pul se paar hun ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Muhajireen mein jo mohtaaj hain (Muhajireen se muraad wo log hain jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath gharbaar chhor kar nikal gaye aur faqr o faqa ki takleef par sabr kiya aur duniya par Laat maari) Yahudi ne kaha ke phir jab wo log jannat mein jayein ge to un ka pehla naashta / tohfa kiya ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke machhli ke jigar ka tukra (jo nihayat mazaydaar aur muqawwi hota hai) us ne kaha phir subah ka khana kiya ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un ke liye wo bail kaata jaye ga jo jannat mein chara karta tha phir us ne poocha ke ye kha kar wo kiya peyein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Salsabeel naami chashma ka pani us Yahudi ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sach farmaya aur mein Aap se aik aisi baat poochnay aaya hun jis ko duniya mein koi nahi janta siwae Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ya shayad aik do aadmi aur jantay hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar mein tujhe wo baat bata dun to tujhe faida ho ga us ne kaha ke mein apne kaan se sun lun ga phir us ne kaha ke mein bachay ke baaray mein poochta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mard ka pani safed hai aur aurat ka pani zard hai jab ye donon ikathay hotay hain aur mard ki mani aurat ki mani par ghalib hoti hai to Allah ke hukm se larka paida hota hai aur jab mard ki mani par aurat ki mani ghalib hoti hai to Allah ke hukm se larki paida hoti hai Yahudi ne kaha ke albatta Aap ne sach kaha aur beshak albatta Aap Nabi hain phir wo lota aur chala gaya pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ne jab mujh se ye sawaalaat kiye to mujhe kisi cheez ka ilm nahi tha hatta ke Allah Taala ne mujhe us ka ilm de diya "
"1964","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs jannat mein jaye ga wo sukoon se ho ga aur be gham rahay ga na kabhi us ke kapray boohon ge aur na us ki jawani mite gi (yani sada jawan hi rahay ga kabhi boorha na ho ga) "
"1965","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein aik darakht hai jis ke saye mein sau baras tak aik sawaar chalay ga aur wo us ko qat' (uboor) na kar sakay ga Hazim ne kaha ke ye hadees mein ne Numan bin Abu Ayyaash Zarqi se bayan ki to unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein aik darakht hai jis ke talay achay tayyar kiye hue taiz ghoray ka sawaar sau baras tak chalay to us ko tamam na kar sakay "
"1966","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein aik kholdaar mauti ka khema ho ga jis ki chaurayi saath meel ki ho gi us ke har konay mein ghar walay hun ge jo doosray konay walon ko na dekhtay hun ge momin un par daura karay ga "
"1967","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat mein aik bazaar hai jis mein jinti log har Juma ke din jama hua karein ge phir shumaali hua chalay gi pas wahan ka gird o ghubaar (jo mushk aur zafraan hai) un ke chehron aur kapron par paray ga pas un ka Hasan o jamaal aur zyada ho jaye ga phir wo pehle se zyada haseen o Jameel ho kar apne gharon ki taraf palat aayein ge pas un se un ke ghar walay kahein ge ke Allah ki qasam ! tumhara Hasan o jamaal hamaray baad to bohat barh gaya hai phir wo jawab dein ge ke Allah ki qasam ! tumhara Hasan o jamaal bhi hamaray baad zyada ho gaya hai "
"1968","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Seehaan Jeehaan Neel aur Furaat jannat ki neheron mein se hain "
"1969","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat un baaton se ghair di gayi hai jo nafs ko nagawar hain aur jahannam nafs ki khwahishon se ghair di gayi hai "
"1970","[AI-translation] ´Abu Tayyaah kehtay hain ke` Mutarrif bin Abdullah ki do aurtein thin wo aik aurat ke paas se aaye to doosri boli ke to falan aurat ke paas se aaya hai Mutarrif ne kaha ke mein Imran bin Husain ke paas se aaya hun unhon ne ham se hadees bayan ki ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat ke rehnay walon mein aurtein bohat kam hain "
"1971","[AI-translation] ´Harisa bin Wahb raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke kiya mein tumhein jannat ke logon ke mutaliq na bataon logon ne kaha ke batlaiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke har kamzor logon ke qareeb zaleel agar Allah ke bharosay par qasam kha le to Allah Taala us ko sacha kar de aur phir farmaya ke kiya mein tumhein dozakh walon ke baaray mein na bataon logon ne arz kiya ke kyun nahi ! batlaiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke har jhaghraalu baray pait wala aur maghroor ya har maal jama karnay wala maghroor "
"1972","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kai log aisay hain ke ghubaaraalood pareshaan haalat mein darwazon par se dhakaile jatay hain (lekin) agar wo Allah Taala ke bharosay par qasam kha baithein to Allah Taala un ki qasam poori kar de (yani Allah ke qareeb maqbool hain go duniyadaaron ki nazron mein haqeer hain) "
"1973","[AI-translation] ´Iyaaz bin Himaar Mujashai raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik din khutba mein farmaya ke aagaah raho ke mere Rab ne mujhe hukm kiya hai ke tumhein wo baatein sikhalaoon jo tumhein maloom nahi hain Allah Taala ne mujhe butayi hain jo maal apne banday ko dun wo us ke liye halal hai (yani jo shara ki ro se haraam nahi hai wo halal hai lekin logon ne us ko haraam kar rakha ho jaisay ghora zebra goh shark machhli waghera) aur mein ne apne sab bandon ko Musalman paida kiya hai (ya gunaahon se paak ya istiqamat par aur hidayat ki qaabiliyat par aur baazon ne kaha ke muraad wo ehad hai jo duniya mein aanay se pehle liya tha) phir un ke paas shaitaan aaye aur un ko un ke deen se hata diya (ya un ke deen se rok diya) aur jo cheezein mein ne un ke liye halal ki thin wo haraam kein aur un ko mere saath shirk karnay ka hukm kiya jis ki mein ne koi daleel nahi utari aur beshak Allah Taala ne zameen walon ko dekha phir kiya Arab kiya Ajam sab ko bura samjha siwae un chand logon ke jo ahl kitab mein se (deen haq par) baaqi thay (yani Arab o Ajam ki aksariyat siwae chand logon ke jo Isa alaihissalam ke pairokaaron mein se tauheed parast thay baaqi Allah Taala ke saath shirk karnay walay thay us liye bura samjha) aur Allah Taala ne farmaya ke mein ne tujhe us liye bheja ke tujhe aazmaaon (sabr aur istiqamat aur kafiron ki eeza par) aur un logon ko aazmaaon jin ke paas tumhein bheja (ke un mein se kaun iman qabool karta hai kaun kafir rehta hai aur kaun munafiq) aur mein ne tujh par aisi kitab utari jis ko pani nahi dhota (kyunke wo kitab sirf kaaghaz par nahi likhi balke seenon par naqsh hai) to us ko sotay jaagtay mein padhta hai aur Allah ne mujhe Quraish ke logon ko jala denay ka hukm kiya (yani shiddat se haq sunanay ka) mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Rab ! wo to mera sar tor kar roti ki tarah kar daalein ge us ke tukray kar dein ge Allah Taala ne farmaya ke un ko nikaal de jaisay unhon ne tujhe nikala aur un se jihad kar ham teri madad karein ge aur kharch kar ham anqareeb tujh par kharch karein ge (yani to Allah ki raah mein kharch kar Allah tujhe de ga) aur to lashkar bhej ham waisay (farishton ke) paanch lashkar bhejein ge aur jo log teri itaat karein un ko le kar un se lar jo tera kaha na manein farmaya ke jannat walay teen shakhs hain aik to wo jo hukumat rakhta hai aur insaaf karta hai sacha hai aur naik kaamon ki taufeeq diya gaya hai doosra wo jo har rishta daar aur Musalman par meharban aur narm dil hai teesra jo paak daaman hai ya sawal nahi karta aur bachon wala hai aur dozakh walay paanch shakhs hain aik to wo kamzor jis ko tameez nahi (ke buri baat se bachay) jo tum mein taabedaar hain na wo gharbaar chahtay hain aur na maal (yani mehz befikri halal haraam se gharz na rakhnay walay aaj to naam nihaad ameer aur hukmraan log bhi daakhil hain) doosra wo chor ke jab us par koi cheez agarchay haqeer ho khulay to wo us ko charaye teesra wo shakhs jo subah aur shaam tujh se tere ghar walon aur tere maal ke muqadma mein fareb karta hai aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bakheel ya jhootay ka bayan kiya (ke wo bhi dozakhi hain) aur Shanzeer yani gaaliaan biknay wala aur fuhsh kehnay wala (wo bhi jahannami hain) "
"1974","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab jannat walay jannat mein chalay jayein ge aur dozakh waaye dozakh mein to maut layi jaye gi aur jannat aur dozakh ke baich mein zabah ki jaye gi phir aik pukaarnay wala pukaaray ga ke Ae jannat walo ! ab maut nahi aur Ae dozakh walo ! ab maut nahi jannat walon ko ye sun kar khushi par khushi hasil ho gi aur dozakh walon ko ranj par ranj zyada ho ga "
